From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] i915: resume pending HDMI checks from native commit completion

Keep link checks in the native HPD worker. Coalesce encoder requests per
pipe until hw_done, preserve current-state guards and existing SCDC policy,
and cancel requests through the existing detection lifecycle.

